- [ ] **Permissions**: Runtime permission flows
- [ ] **Performance**: Memory usage and app responsiveness
- [ ] **UI/UX**: Different screen sizes and orientations

### Production Testing
- [ ] **Release Build**: Test with ProGuard enabled
